  "body": "Currently, the spec requires (or synapse requires, unsure at this point) that when reading something from a room (e.g an event) that an appservice must masquerade as a user within that room. This is unhelpful if the appservice isn't aware of who is in the room, only that one of it's users are in there.\r\n\r\nIf an appservice has any users joined to a room, it should be able to query event information from that room without having to supply a user_id parameter. ",
